.TH "RAPTOR-CONFIG" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-config \- List, read or change the settings the desktop application keeps (QSettings) and the CLI defaults.
.SH SYNOPSIS
